  "_readme": "Written by grok_usage.py in the data directory (gitignored). Sessions do not record the signed-in account. watermark is the newest updatedAt already seen. A session updated after that is tagged with the account in ~/.grok/auth.json at that moment. Older sessions stay unattributed until then. Do not put a real email in this example.",
